Het CoRR-cg-sys-relaxed-x86_64
"Heterogeneous CoRR-cg-sys-relaxed-x86_64: per-proc device assignment cpu,gpu (cpu=x86_64, gpu=LISA/PTX)"
{
}
 P0:x86_64     | P1:gpu             ;
 movl (x),%eax | w[relaxed,sys] x 1 ;
 movl (x),%ebx |                    ;
scopes: (sys (gpu (cta P1)))
exists (0:rax=1 /\ 0:rbx=0)
